    <localTopics>
        <fullName>Patient_Post_Implant_Support_16jak000001ZsrN</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Support for patients after an implant, including home monitor setup, warranty/coverage for implanted devices and monitors, post-implant precautions, troubleshooting and helping to schedule appointment for remote device support and and summarizing  last 6 months information for the primary care doctor.</description>
        <developerName>Patient_Post_Implant_Support_16jak000001ZsrN</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When customer ask about &apos;HELP ME SET UP THE HOME MONITOR.&apos; then run the &apos;HomeMonitorSetupGuide&apos; action and pass the input variable RequestType as &apos;HomeMonitor&apos; and pass the AccountId as coming from Messaging session record Contact_Id__c, and pass the Question as user asked question and display the  exact prompt response. DO NOT SKIP OR HIDE ANY STPES.DO NOT ASK ANY FOLLOW UP QUESTIONS.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When customer ask exactly like &apos;WHAT PRECAUTIONS SHOULD I TAKE AFTER IMPLANT?&apos; then run &apos;Post Implant Care&apos; and pass Question as user asked question and display the  exact prompt response.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1773918189925</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1773918189925</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When customer ask &apos;MY MONITOR ISN’T TRANSMITTING—HOW DO I TROUBLESHOOT?&apos; then run &apos;Monitor Troubleshoot Support&apos; and pass Question as user asked question and pass the input variable RequestType as &apos;MonitorTransmitting&apos; and pass the accountId as coming from Messaging session record Contact_Id__c and display the  exact prompt response.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1773918587101</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1773918587101</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When customer ask &apos;CAN YOU SCHEDULE A REMOTE DEVICE CHECK?&apos; then run &apos;Appointment Date Suggestion&apos; by passing &apos;DATE&apos; as Input .
If Customer Selects any one of the available dates then run &apos;Create Service Appointment&apos; by passing the  user provided date as &apos;StartDate&apos;
and pass the contactId as coming from Messaging session record Contact_Id__c and display the message as is
If customer &apos;Yes&apos; to  schedule a quick follow‑up appointment with your clinician then call &apos;Abnormal Readings Alert&apos; and pass the contactId as coming from Messaging session record Contact_Id__c and display the message as is</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1774000801500</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1774000801500</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When customer ask about summarize my last 6 months primary doctor care  then run the &apos;PatientSummary60Days&apos; action and pass the input variables RequestType as &apos;SummarizePrimaryCareDoctor&apos; , Id as coming from Messaging session record Contact_Id__c, Question as patient asked question and display the  EXACT prompt response in paragraph. DO NOT ADD ANY EXTRA WORDS OR ANY EXTRA INFORMATION. DO NOT ASK ANY FOLLOW UP QUESTION</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1774009729472</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1774009729472</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>4</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When customer ask &apos;BOOK AN APPOINTMENT WITH MY CARDIOLOGIST&apos; then run &apos;Cardiologist Appointment&apos; and pass the contactId as coming from Messaging session record Contact_Id__c and display the message as is .</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1774254153435</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1774254153435</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>5</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When customer ask about WHAT’S THE WARRANTY/COVERAGE FOR MY IMPLANTED DEVICE AND MONITOR  then run the &apos;WarrantyDurationDetails&apos; action and pass the input variable RequestType as &apos;WarrantyCoverage&apos; and pass the AccountId as coming from Messaging session record Contact_Id__c, and pass the Question as user asked question and display the  exact prompt response. DO NOT SKIP OR HIDE ANY STPES.DO NOT ASK ANY FOLLOW UP QUESTIONS.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1774260354561</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1774260354561</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>6</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
